    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/5dd1bbbadecef4327990d86840f69fd6.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d2a48f5c0f350a6de58c89b8c312fb62.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d2a48f5c0f350a6de58c89b8c312fb62.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d2a48f5c0f350a6de58c89b8c312fb62.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a plethora of different towers to build an impenetrable defense. Some towers buff, some towers heal, others launch black holes that will wipe out hundreds of enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/50c7807b619e29d03a4134bffd65651c.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/27c61a151db40b01b7b6bac49ef45181.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/27c61a151db40b01b7b6bac49ef45181.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/27c61a151db40b01b7b6bac49ef45181.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After setting up your defenses, earn money and become stronger as you explore the dungeon. Clear out as many rooms as you can to reach deeper levels. Don't forget to periodically make trips back to your home base  to repair and upgrade your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/dddb81fcc5a0e9e14da3ebe82dddfab8.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/9b497aef4c8cf9884a322d82d8581928.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/9b497aef4c8cf9884a322d82d8581928.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/9b497aef4c8cf9884a322d82d8581928.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 100+  items  with unique abilities and stat buffs. Unlock more items as you play to keep every run fresh. Chests and shopkeepers are scattered throughout the dungeon, so keep an eye out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/1e3332539b5285e364e00295395073ad.avif?t=1751935984\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in single-player or in multiplayer co-op with up to 4 players, seamlessly integrated with Steam multiplayer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/83a5277c36eac8a43b7757473b1ee112.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d530b941aa8d57360c145e8af282a1ea.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d530b941aa8d57360c145e8af282a1ea.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d530b941aa8d57360c145e8af282a1ea.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolster your stats to no end. Design your load-out to make wiping out enemies a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/e34a9eace241d1e25e8ab06965689e29.webp?t=1751935984\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/5dd1bbbadecef4327990d86840f69fd6.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d2a48f5c0f350a6de58c89b8c312fb62.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d2a48f5c0f350a6de58c89b8c312fb62.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d2a48f5c0f350a6de58c89b8c312fb62.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a plethora of different towers to build an impenetrable defense. Some towers buff, some towers heal, others launch black holes that will wipe out hundreds of enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/50c7807b619e29d03a4134bffd65651c.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/27c61a151db40b01b7b6bac49ef45181.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/27c61a151db40b01b7b6bac49ef45181.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/27c61a151db40b01b7b6bac49ef45181.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After setting up your defenses, earn money and become stronger as you explore the dungeon. Clear out as many rooms as you can to reach deeper levels. Don't forget to periodically make trips back to your home base  to repair and upgrade your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/dddb81fcc5a0e9e14da3ebe82dddfab8.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/9b497aef4c8cf9884a322d82d8581928.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/9b497aef4c8cf9884a322d82d8581928.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/9b497aef4c8cf9884a322d82d8581928.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 100+  items  with unique abilities and stat buffs. Unlock more items as you play to keep every run fresh. Chests and shopkeepers are scattered throughout the dungeon, so keep an eye out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/1e3332539b5285e364e00295395073ad.avif?t=1751935984\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in single-player or in multiplayer co-op with up to 4 players, seamlessly integrated with Steam multiplayer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/83a5277c36eac8a43b7757473b1ee112.avif?t=1751935984\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d530b941aa8d57360c145e8af282a1ea.poster.avif?t=1751935984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d530b941aa8d57360c145e8af282a1ea.webm?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/d530b941aa8d57360c145e8af282a1ea.mp4?t=1751935984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolster your stats to no end. Design your load-out to make wiping out enemies a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250460/extras/e34a9eace241d1e25e8ab06965689e29.webp?t=1751935984\" /></span></p>",
